Typhoon Tino (Kalmaegi) has struck the Philippines, affecting over 2 million people.

Flooding and power outages have displaced tens of thousands.

@philredcross is providing food, first aid, psychosocial support.

@IFRC has launched 18 million CHF appeal to reach 285 000. https://t.co/e88RpAuoNe
